The values embedded in `src/builtins/wda_minimal/tokens/tokens.json` and
`src/builtins/wda_minimal/pages/index.html` are a one-time snapshot of
@adobe/spectrum-tokens 15.2.0 defaults, taken at implementation time. They
have been modified from the upstream source: remapped from Spectrum's
vendor token identifiers onto Web Design Anchor's own project-scoped
semantic key paths (for example `color.brand.primary`, `spacing.md`), and
the font family tokens have been changed to a Noto-first font stack. The
upstream package is not vendored, redistributed, or referenced as a
runtime or build-time dependency; only the resulting numeric and string
values are reused.

This snapshot is frozen and does not track upstream releases. A future
refresh is a deliberate action that re-reads @adobe/spectrum-tokens at a
newly chosen version and updates this NOTICE to record that version.

